msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Something terrible's happened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"My company's accusing me of embezzlement, but I haven't done a darn thing, "
"and... I... I don't know what to do!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "How exactly did this happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Heck, I have no idea! Somehow, two million yen just showed up in my bank "
"account outta the blue..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I swear, I would've remembered depositing that much! But it's too late "
"now... I'm already at the station, being read my rights..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Kiryu-san... What am I supposed to do...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Let's calm down and think this through together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Mm... Afraid I can't do that. They're saying time's up. I'll call ya again "
"later if I can..."
msgstr ""

